    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just quiet. it feels like the whole world is just... pointless. he was the only one who actually cared about me, even if it was just because i fed him. now that he's gone, what's the actual reason to keep doing all this? waking up, working, coming back to an empty house? it feels like i'm just going through the motions for no reason at all.",
